{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Echoes of a Dying Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/59fb0f5764fb08c692318932f2ec7305.poster.avif?t=1770903663\" width=780 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/59fb0f5764fb08c692318932f2ec7305.webm?t=1770903663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world beyond repair, where only the strongest persevere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lorn Vale is a free-roaming post-apocalyptic Survival Sandbox RPG. Can you endure the merciless cruelty of a land on the brink of oblivion? Your mission is to survive, climb the food chain, and carve out a living by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is shaped by every choice and action you take, ensuring that no two playthroughs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/c626f82efb916b9b8c4e600c7f7409d5.poster.avif?t=1770903663\" width=780 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/c626f82efb916b9b8c4e600c7f7409d5.webm?t=1770903663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension as you engage in real-time tactical combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is a test of your skill and wits, where survival is never granted, and sometimes you barely make it through the day (or night).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt and Overcome</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/0f47427c45272960bb5e89ededc28b03.poster.avif?t=1770903663\" width=780 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/0f47427c45272960bb5e89ededc28b03.webm?t=1770903663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice plays a key part in creating your own unique character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your stats and skills, pick from several backgrounds, experiment with game-changing mutations, and even form alliances with a multitude of different factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in a Ruined World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/7ab492a06f22072694aff57fd9565bf5.poster.avif?t=1770903663\" width=780 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/7ab492a06f22072694aff57fd9565bf5.webm?t=1770903663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the barren wastelands and encounter the eccentric residents who have no choice but to call it home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with wandering caravans, pick up bounties and find refuge in what few towns still exist. Experience a savage, handcrafted open-world where the map stays the same, but encounters and events are always different.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2869850?t=1770903663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2869850?t=1770903663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/3a85911d8d7b425ed6d04c2256e539daed86a7a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770903663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/3a85911d8d7b425ed6d04c2256e539daed86a7a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770903663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains blood splatters and violence towards characters in a 2D-pixel art style.\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Echoes of a Dying Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/59fb0f5764fb08c692318932f2ec7305.poster.avif?t=1770903663\" width=780 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869850/extras/59fb0f5764fb08c692318932f2ec7305.webm?t=1770903663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world beyond repair, where only the strongest persevere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lorn Vale is a free-roaming post-apocalyptic Survival Sandbox RPG. Can you endure the merciless cruelty of a land on the brink of oblivion? Your mission is to survive, climb the food chain, and carve out a 